WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.800
Hey guys,
Why is discipline&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:09.680
so important, so crucial in a man's life?
Because if you don't have self-control,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:16.960
what makes you different from an animal that&nbsp;
only lives according to its urges and desires?&nbsp;

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:22.680
Wise men are extremely disciplined&nbsp;
in every aspect of their lives,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:28.040
because they understand that they need&nbsp;
to sacrifice temporary things and wants,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.040 --> 00:00:34.160
desires, you know, in order to&nbsp;
achieve what they want most in life.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:35.520
[Hebrews 12:11]

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:55.160
You know, your feelings, your&nbsp;
emotions, are good to have.&nbsp;

00:00:55.160 --> 00:01:00.520
You know, on one end, but on the&nbsp;
other end it's like a two-edged sword.&nbsp;

00:01:00.520 --> 00:01:05.920
You know, because it can cut inward as well.
It can give you joy and those kind of feelings,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:09.440
but, when it cuts inward you&nbsp;
know it can make you crave&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:13.760
things that you know are actually&nbsp;
not good for you in the long term.&nbsp;

00:01:13.760 --> 00:01:19.760
And that's where discipline comes in.
For example, you might not feel like&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:25.400
studying now to become a doctor&nbsp;
later which is what you really want.&nbsp;

00:01:25.400 --> 00:01:33.040
Or, you might not feel like eating healthy&nbsp;
and working out now to get a good body later.&nbsp;

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:39.000
But that is what you really want.
So, you discipline yourself in every&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.000 --> 00:01:44.640
area of your life, especially when you know&nbsp;
those times where you experience temporary&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:44.640 --> 00:01:47.720
things that you don't really want to do.
You feel it in your shoulder, like man,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.720 --> 00:01:49.880
I don't really want to do this.
I don't feel like it.&nbsp;

00:01:49.880 --> 00:01:53.720
But you do it anyway, you sacrifice&nbsp;
that part of your life, right?&nbsp;

00:01:53.720 --> 00:01:57.680
You're like - man - I'm going to do what&nbsp;
needs to be done even if I don't like it.&nbsp;

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:03.640
I'm going to endure it so that I can go through&nbsp;
this part of my life that's temporary and achieve&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:10.640
that which - what I want most in my life.
So you need to discipline yourself,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.640 --> 00:02:13.000
to have self-control.
Paul said:

00:02:13.000 --> 00:02:14.800
[1 Corinthians 9:24-27]

00:02:56.200 --> 00:03:00.280
Now, how can you be more disciplined?
You probably think - well - I have to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:03.560
do this and this and this and this&nbsp;
and that's where you're wrong.&nbsp;

00:03:03.560 --> 00:03:07.840
It's not about you.
You have to do nothing.&nbsp;

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:10.160
Let me explain.
You have to do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.160 --> 00:03:18.320
nothing in your own little human power because by&nbsp;
yourself, on your own, you can accomplish nothing.&nbsp;

00:03:18.320 --> 00:03:25.520
You cannot have effective 100 percent self-control&nbsp;
in every aspect of your life if you try to do it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:28.480
by yourself, because you are the problem.
Jesus said:

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:29.680
[John 15:5]

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:48.280
Do you get it?&nbsp;

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:53.640
One of the fruits of the Spirit is self-control.
So if you live through the Spirit - the power&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.640 --> 00:03:58.400
of the Holy Spirit - then you will be&nbsp;
able to produce the fruit of the Spirit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:02.360
and one of them is self-control.
And this is not your own power,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:06.480
on your soul level.
It is a spiritual power.

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:08.760
[Galatians 5:22-23]

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:32.840
So, if you're a reborn Christian and you&nbsp;
say, well, I don't have self-control,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:36.720
then in a sense, you're right, because&nbsp;
we all have that sinful fleshly nature&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:42.840
within us and it's going to be there until&nbsp;
the day we die and it pushes us to do sin.&nbsp;

00:04:42.840 --> 00:04:47.000
Like overeating - gluttony -&nbsp;
getting angry - and quarrel.&nbsp;

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:51.120
Or not study but be lazy.
It is that fleshly nature&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:58.400
within you that brings you down.
But you see, if you are a true reborn Christian,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:02.120
you have received a new spiritual nature.
God Himself, the Holy Spirit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:06.760
came and lives inside of you.
You see, there is a change.&nbsp;

00:05:06.760 --> 00:05:13.200
And now, you can choose to live through the&nbsp;
Spirit, and the Spirit can overcome the flesh.&nbsp;

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:19.720
And it is the only power that can overcome the&nbsp;
sinful nature because you cannot overcome it.&nbsp;

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:22.280
Because it is in you.
You are the problem.&nbsp;

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:25.440
It is your emotions.
It is your desires that is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:25.440 --> 00:05:29.680
pushing you to do things that you don't&nbsp;
really want to do and later you regret.&nbsp;

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:34.640
And you're like, man, why did I do this?
Is because of the sinful nature within you.&nbsp;

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:39.200
And some people, they get frustrated,&nbsp;
they get angry, you know, and sad.&nbsp;

00:05:39.200 --> 00:05:41.920
Because, man, they don't&nbsp;
understand themselves anymore.&nbsp;

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:45.080
Why do they keep on doing&nbsp;
things which they regret later?&nbsp;

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:49.400
And it seems like they&nbsp;
can't have any self-control.&nbsp;

00:05:49.400 --> 00:05:53.000
Some even get afraid because&nbsp;
they don't know what to do.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:54.680
[2 Timothy 1:7]

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:10.880
If you want to be more disciplined - if you do it&nbsp;
on your your own little human power - that level&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.880 --> 00:06:17.280
just on your soul level - you know you can try to&nbsp;
do it to some degree, but you will always reach&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:21.840
that area where you're stuck.
But you can do it through&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:25.560
the Spirit that is in you.
So if you want to learn how to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:25.560 --> 00:06:29.480
discipline yourself, grow in Christ.
He is the answer.&nbsp;

00:06:29.480 --> 00:06:32.840
Living through the Spirit.
That is the key.&nbsp;

00:06:32.840 --> 00:06:37.680
When you start growing in Christ, you learn truth.
You start to understand the truth.&nbsp;

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:43.520
You write it on your heart.
You start to live it, and then everything changes.&nbsp;

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:47.560
Especially having self-discipline,&nbsp;
because now you're not on your own.&nbsp;

00:06:47.560 --> 00:06:51.880
You're not struggling through life.
You understand a bigger picture of life.&nbsp;

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:55.840
You open the tap to let the&nbsp;
power of God flow through you.&nbsp;

00:06:55.840 --> 00:06:59.680
The Holy Spirit.
And you just follow him.

00:06:59.680 --> 00:07:01.880
[Philippians 4:13]

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:14.160
You know, certain people ask me sometimes,&nbsp;
Daniel, how are you so determined?&nbsp;

00:07:14.160 --> 00:07:17.240
You know, how do you have self-control?
Well, it's not me.&nbsp;

00:07:17.240 --> 00:07:20.800
It's all because of God.
When I was younger I struggled&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:27.160
with self-discipline, believe it or&nbsp;
not, until God revealed Himself to me.&nbsp;

00:07:27.160 --> 00:07:31.520
I accepted Him as Lord and Savior.
And then I started to grow spiritually.&nbsp;

00:07:31.520 --> 00:07:37.080
Jesus also talks about those of little faith.
But you can grow in your faith and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.080 --> 00:07:41.680
that is what makes you stronger.
It is God that teaches us how to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:47.240
have self-discipline, to control our thoughts,&nbsp;
to take all those thoughts captive, you know,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:52.080
and bring it under the Lordship of Jesus Christ.
It is He that helped me to control my&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:57.520
thoughts - my body - my actions - everything.
And He can help you too if you ask Him.

00:07:57.520 --> 00:07:59.320
[Proverbs 12:1]

00:08:06.840 --> 00:08:09.000
Now, if you want to understand this more,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:09.000 --> 00:08:13.800
especially the difference of living&nbsp;
through the Spirit and not the flesh,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.800 --> 00:08:19.760
then please get my free eBook I'll add it&nbsp;
for you in the video description down below.&nbsp;

00:08:19.760 --> 00:08:26.000
And then you can also watch these videos here.
And before you go, always remember, life is short,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:26.000 --> 00:08:29.240
so don't waste yours.
Cheers guys.

